# High Cloud Airlines Data Analysis ✈️

## 📊 Tools Used
- Advanced Excel
- SQl
- Power BI

## 📌 Project Description
This project analyzes airline data to find insights like passenger trends, revenue, and performance.

## 📂 Files Included
- SQL Queries
- Power BI Dashboard
- Excel Analysis

## 🚀 Key Insights
- Peak travel seasons identified
- Revenue trends analyzed
- Flight performance improved
